{"ID":"20230927165013-zogurf0","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927165013-zogurf0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165013-zogurf0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165021-63k3uiu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165021-grou70q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165021-grou70q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:105,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:105\u0026#125;","title":"肉桂","type":"doc","updated":"20230927165021"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927165021-63k3uiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927165021-63k3uiu","updated":"20230927165021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉桂，。"}]},{"ID":"20230927165021-grou70q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927165021-grou70q","updated":"20230927165021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉桂好坏的区别：坏的肉桂吃了之后上焦容易上火，不能够补命门，好的肉桂才能沉下去补命门不上火。那能够引火归元的好肉桂呢，一定是香甜肥油，但是不辣，就是辣味淡而香气油分浓厚的肉桂才是好肉桂，辣味很重的肉桂是烂肉桂。"}]}]}